  "description": "Yu-Jin was once a top student with dreams of becoming a doctor until her first love, the rebellious Jun-Ha, turned her carefully planned life upside down. After blaming him for losing her shot at medical school, she vows never to see him again. Years later, they're reunited in a college study group as she prepares for one final chance to achieve her dream. Determined to make amends, Jun-Ha refuses to leave her side, forcing Yu-Jin to confront the boy she once loved and the man he's become. As old feelings resurface, she must decide if love deserves a second chance.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
